### ZkIssuer API smoke checks
### Use this file in JetBrains HTTP Client. Run top-to-bottom.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
#@baseUrl = https://issuer.example.org

### 0) Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### 1) Create credential type
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/credentials/types
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "typeName": "ResidencePermit",
  "requiredClaimKeys": ["first_name", "last_name", "permit_number"]
}

### 1.1) Create credential type
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/credentials/types
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "typeName": "UniversityDegree",
  "requiredClaimKeys": ["first_name", "last_name", "birth_date", "student_id", "graduation_year", "faculty", "degree"]
}

### 2) List all credential types
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/credentials/types

### 3) List credential type names only
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/credentials/types/names

### 4) Get one credential type by name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/credentials/types/ResidencePermit

### 5) Head check for one credential type
HEAD {{baseUrl}}/api/credentials/types/ResidencePermit

### 6) Patch credential type (add required key)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/credentials/types/ResidencePermit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requiredClaimKeys": ["first_name", "last_name", "permit_number", "country_code"]
}

### 7) Create credential request (works when VALIDATE_CREDENTIAL_TYPE=false)
### Copy transactionId from response.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/credentials/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialType": "ResidencePermit",
  "claims": {
    "first_name": "Maksym",
    "last_name": "Hnatov",
    "permit_number": "RP-2026-551",
    "country_code": "UA"
  }
}

### 8) Poll credential offer by transaction id (replace TXN-...)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/credentials/offers/TXN-940f0c7d-74ae-4a80-a6a5-44ebbf5ffacf

### 9) Create credential request with missing claim
### Expected:
### - 202 if VALIDATE_CREDENTIAL_TYPE=false
### - 400 if VALIDATE_CREDENTIAL_TYPE=true
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/credentials/requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "credentialType": "ResidencePermit",
  "claims": {
    "first_name": "Maksym",
    "last_name": "Hnatov"
  }
}

### 10) List credential requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/credentials/requests

### 11) Approve request by id (replace 1 with real id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/credentials/requests/3/approve

### 12) Poll credential offer again (should contain credential token when APPROVED)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/credentials/offers/TXN-REPLACE_ME

### 13) List approved requests
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/credentials/requests?status=APPROVED

### 14) Delete credential type
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/credentials/types/ResidencePermit
